{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "125c4c70-c012-8e67-b427-639a00ed9828",
  "created_at": "2026-01-13T12:37:32-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sheila Cullen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:35:56-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:35:58-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. My name is Sheila Cullen. I would like to inquire about flooding at the low spot at the end of my block. It is at 408 Bliss Road, on the Easton's Beach side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:36:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Ms. Cullen. What's it doing out there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:36:12-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is under about a foot of water. That is three days after the coastal storm Friday and Saturday, and it has not drained at all. Cars are turning around rather than driving through it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:36:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A foot, wow. Is that the drain at the end of the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:36:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I believe so. A neighbor told me it happens every big rain. So this is not new, and I am quite tired of it being treated as though it were."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:36:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Let me get this down. Four-oh-eight Bliss Road, standing water at the low spot, about a foot, since the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:36:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is correct. I would like to know whether a work order will be opened, and for what date. I would rather not be told someone will look into it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:36:52-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can open the request right now. The date I can't promise, because crews are still working through storm calls. But it goes in the queue today and someone will be assigned."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:37:02-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand, but I would like a date, if one can be given. [pause] I am also waiting on a package of winter boots, and the driver may not be able to get down the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:37:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll note that the road is impassable for deliveries. Can I have a callback number so the supervisor can give you a date?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:37:21-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Certainly. It is 401-555-0177."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:37:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll flag it as a repeat problem since your neighbor says it floods every time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:37:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I will expect a call."
    }
  ],
